[b] Event Time: As of June 11, 2023 00:00 [/b]

[b] Champions League final [/b]
Manchester City - Internazionale

[b] Guess rules [/b]
Method 1: Guess which team has successfully advanced to the Champions League final;
Method 2: Guess the score during the regular time of the Champions League final (90 minutes+extra time).

[b] Activity Rules [/b]
1. During the activity time, the "reply" function below the activity or enter the community chat group private message administrator to guess the content;
(Example 1: Manchester City)
(Example 2:  2:0)
2. The participation time for the competition's guessing must be replied within the activity time. If it expires, the guessing will be invalid;
3. Method 1: Guess the team that successfully advanced and receive the gift pack. Guess the score correctly in Method 2 to receive the gift package. Two guessing methods can be used simultaneously, and a single player can receive up to one gift package;
4. The gift package will be distributed within 3 working days after the game is launched. The validity period of the gift package is 30 days, and it will be used as soon as possible after the game is launched;
5. In order to prevent replacing or stealing gift packages, we will add player friends who have participated in the activity and successfully guessed through Steam, and distribute them through private chat;
6. Each gift pack can only be used once by each player and cannot be reused;
7. Any violations of the activity (malicious posting, continuous replies, multi IP and multi account posting, building control) will be disqualified from winning the prize once verified;
8. The final interpretation of this activity belongs to the operation team of "Soccer Clubs 足球经理人".
